:6:14","transliteration":{"text":"ʿalā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَا","location":"49:6:15","transliteration":{"text":"mā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَعَلْتُمْ","location":"49:6:16","transliteration":{"text":"faʿaltum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"نَـٰدِمِينَ","location":"49:6:17","transliteration":{"text":"nādimīna"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٦","location":"49:6:18","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Ey inananlar! Eğer yoldan çıkmışın biri size bir haber getirirse, onun iç yüzünü araştırın, yoksa bilmeden bir millete fenalık edersiniz de sonra ettiğinize pişman olursunuz.","transliteration":"yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū in jāakum fāsiqun binaba-in fatabayyanū an tuṣībū qawman bijahālatin fatuṣ'biḥū ʿalā mā faʿaltum nādimīna"},{"id":4619,"verse_key":"49:7","verse_number":7,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","location":"49:7:1","transliteration":{"text":"wa-iʿ'lamū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","location":"49:7:2","transliteration":{"text":"anna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فِيكُمْ","location":"49:7:3","transliteration":{"text":"fīkum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"رَسُولَ","location":"49:7:4","transliteration":{"text":"rasūla"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","location":"49:7:5","transliteration":{"text":"l-lahi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَوْ","location":"49:7:6","transliteration":{"text":"law"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يُطِيعُكُمْ","location":"49:7:7","transliteration":{"text":"yuṭīʿukum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فِى","location":"49:7:8","transliteration":{"text":"fī"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"كَثِيرٍۢ","location":"49:7:9","transliteration":{"text":"kathīrin"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","location":"49:7:10","transliteration":{"text":"mina"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرِ","location":"