","transliteration":{"text":"l-ẓālimūna"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"١١","location":"49:11:40","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Ey inananlar! Bir topluluk bir diğerini alaya almasın, belki de onlar kendilerinden daha iyidirler. Kadınlar da başka kadınları alaya almasınlar, belki onlar kendilerinden daha iyidirler. Kendi kendinizi ayıplamayın; birbirinizi kötü lakaplarla çağırmayın; inandıktan sonra yoldan çıkmış olmak ne kötü bir addır. Tevbe etmeyenler, işte onlar zalimlerdir.","transliteration":"yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā yaskhar qawmun min qawmin ʿasā an yakūnū khayran min'hum walā nisāon min nisāin ʿasā an yakunna khayran min'hunna walā talmizū anfusakum walā tanābazū bil-alqābi bi'sa l-s'mu l-fusūqu baʿda l-īmāni waman lam yatub fa-ulāika humu l-ẓālimūna"},{"id":4624,"verse_key":"49:12","verse_number":12,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","location":"49:12:1","transliteration":{"text":"yāayyuhā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","location":"49:12:2","transliteration":{"text":"alladhīna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","location":"49:12:3","transliteration":{"text":"āmanū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱجْتَنِبُوا۟","location":"49:12:4","transliteration":{"text":"ij'tanibū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","location":"49:12:5","transliteration":{"text":"kathīran"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","location":"49:12:6","transliteration":{"text":"mina"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّنِّ","location":"49:12:7","transliteration":{"text":"l-ẓani"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","location":"49:12:8","transliteration":{"text":"inna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"بَعْضَ","location":"49:12:9","transliteration":{"text":"baʿḍa"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّنِّ","location":"49:12:10","transliteration":{"text":"l-ẓani"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani"