":"shuʿūban"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَقَبَآئِلَ","location":"49:13:10","transliteration":{"text":"waqabāila"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لِتَعَارَفُوٓا۟ ۚ","location":"49:13:11","transliteration":{"text":"litaʿārafū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","location":"49:13:12","transliteration":{"text":"inna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَكْرَمَكُمْ","location":"49:13:13","transliteration":{"text":"akramakum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عِندَ","location":"49:13:14","transliteration":{"text":"ʿinda"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","location":"49:13:15","transliteration":{"text":"l-lahi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَتْقَىٰكُمْ ۚ","location":"49:13:16","transliteration":{"text":"atqākum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","location":"49:13:17","transliteration":{"text":"inna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","location":"49:13:18","transliteration":{"text":"l-laha"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","location":"49:13:19","transliteration":{"text":"ʿalīmun"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۭ","location":"49:13:20","transliteration":{"text":"khabīrun"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"١٣","location":"49:13:21","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Ey insanlar! Doğrusu Biz sizleri bir erkekle bir dişiden yarattık. Sizi milletler ve kabileler haline koyduk ki birbirinizi kolayca tanıyasınız. Şüphesiz, Allah katında en değerliniz, O'na karşı gelmekten en çok sakınanızdır. Allah bilendir, haberdardır.","transliteration":"yāayyuhā l-nāsu innā khalaqnākum min dhakarin wa-unthā wajaʿalnākum shuʿūban waqabāila litaʿārafū inna akramakum ʿinda l-lahi atqākum inna l-laha ʿalīmun khabīrun"},{"id":4626,"verse_key":"49:14","verse_number":14,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"۞ قَالَتِ","location":"49:14:1","transliteration":{"text":"qālati"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_u